        "accordion_zBGHUq": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQ",
            "content": "<p><strong>How durable is the Titan Smart Cable?</strong><br/><br/>Our cable is engineered with durability as a top priority.<br/><br/>Constructed with triple nylon braiding and reinforced metal connector tips, it withstands up to 1,500 lbs of force—ensuring longevity that outlasts your device.<br/><br/>Say goodbye to frayed or worn-out cables with Titan Power.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>What devices is this cable compatible with?</strong><br/><br/>Our charging cable works with all conventional mobile devices, including new releases.<br/><br/>While we can’t list every model, it supports major brands and can also charge everyday items like:<br/><br/>• Speakers<br/><br/>• Headphones<br/><br/>• Tablets<br/><br/>• Cameras<br/><br/>• Controllers<br/><br/><em>Note: Larger devices like MacBooks are not compatible with this cable.</em><strong>How does the warranty work?</strong><br/><br/>We’re so confident in our cable’s durability, it comes with a <strong>2 year warranty.</strong><br/><br/>All other products include a <strong>60-day warranty</strong>.<br/><br/>If anything happens, we’ll send you a brand-new cable—free of charge.<br/><br/>The warranty covers defects in materials or workmanship, and even unexpected damage.<br/><br/><em>However, intentional or unconventional damage is not covered.</em><br/><br/>Please note: replacement cables are not covered under this warranty.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Is this cable safe to use with my device?</strong><br/><br/>Yes. The Titan Smart Cable delivers fast charging at an amperage level supported by your device—so it’s completely safe to use.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Does the Titan Smart Cable support fast charging?</strong><br/><br/>Absolutely! It’s engineered for ultra-fast charging—delivering quick, efficient power so you can stay connected without the wait.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>How long is the Titan Power Cable?</strong><br/><br/>We offer three convenient lengths:<br/><br/>• 1.2m<br/><br/>• 1.8m<br/><br/>• 3.0m<br/><br/>Choose what fits best for your setup and charging needs.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>How does the Titan Smart Cable prevent bending and fraying?</strong><br/><br/>The cable features a <strong>90° right-angle head design</strong>—which reduces stress at the connector and prevents bending.<br/><br/>That means longer life, less wear, and no more frayed ends.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Can I use the Titan Smart Cable with other accessories like power banks or car chargers?</strong><br/><br/>Yes! Our cable is fully compatible with power banks, car chargers, and other accessories—perfect for travel and on-the-go charging.<br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Does the Titan Smart Cable come with a cable tie for storage and organization?</strong><br/><br/>Yes. Each cable includes a convenient <strong>cable tie</strong> so you can wrap, store, and stay organized wherever you go.<br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
